VERIFY: Record effective settings and bidirectional ping; explain which fields matter for same-subnet traffic.
RESET: Return endpoints to DHCP/baseline and confirm no static values remain.
PRINTED SERVICE LOG: Address card, before/after configuration, duplicate check, bidirectional proof, individual role.
SCOPE BOUNDARY: VLAN and static-route configuration are not assessed or authorized.', '{"scope":{"response":"Only the two replacement laptops are in scope; do not alter Cisco device configuration.","quality":"exact"},"timing_change":{"response":"The issue was noticed during today''s setup; no other change is confirmed.","quality":"exact"},"symptom_error":{"response":"There is no additional error message beyond the symptom in the ticket.","quality":"exact"},"environment_equipment":{"response":"Use the two assigned laptops and the access switch shown on the station card.","quality":"exact"},"prior_troubleshooting":{"response":"No troubleshooting was attempted before the ticket was opened.","quality":"exact"},"impact_urgency":{"response":"This blocks the assigned lab station, but no production service is affected.","quality":"exact"}}'::jsonb),
  ('sc-net-f26-05', 'SETUP: Equivalent cards drawn from /26, /27, and /28 networks with equal calculation load; include one invalid proposed address. Preparation rotation uses paper before any equipment.
DIAGNOSTIC BRANCHES: Wrong boundary, invalid reserved address, insufficient hosts, or mismatched prefix.
