SCOPE BOUNDARY: VLAN and static-route configuration are not assessed or authorized.', '{"scope":{"response":"Validate only the subnet card assigned to you.","quality":"exact"},"timing_change":{"response":"The issue was noticed during today''s setup; no other change is confirmed.","quality":"exact"},"symptom_error":{"response":"At least one proposed address may be the network address, broadcast address, or outside the assigned subnet.","quality":"exact"},"environment_equipment":{"response":"Use the assigned Cisco pod and the two designated lab laptops.","quality":"exact"},"prior_troubleshooting":{"response":"No troubleshooting was attempted before the ticket was opened.","quality":"exact"},"impact_urgency":{"response":"This blocks the assigned lab station, but no production service is affected.","quality":"exact"}}'::jsonb),
  ('sc-net-f26-06', 'SETUP: One switch per active team, console path, two laptops, known-good patch leads, pod-specific hostname/credential card. Baseline contains no student config.
ROTATIONS: Team A configures while Team B calculates/annotates port and verification plan; swap. Every student must make a console change or cable/verify a port.
DIAGNOSTIC BRANCHES: Wrong console port/settings, administratively down port, bad cable, or mistaken password report. No VLAN work.
VERIFY: show running-config identity, interface status, learned MACs, and endpoint ping.
RESET: erase startup-config/reload or execute approved baseline script; verify baseline prompt and inventory cables.
PRINTED SERVICE LOG: Commands with purpose (no passwords), port/MAC evidence, ping proof, personal console/cabling contribution.
SCOPE BOUNDARY: VLAN and static-route configuration are not assessed or authorized.', '{"scope":{"response":"Only the equipment named in this ticket is affected.","quality":"exact"},"timing_change":{"response":"The issue was noticed during today''s setup; no other change is confirmed.","quality":"exact"},"symptom_error":{"response":"There is no additional error message beyond the symptom in the ticket.","quality":"exact"},"environment_equipment":{"response":"Use the assigned Cisco switch, console cable, two laptops, and sealed lab credential card.","quality":"exact"},"prior_troubleshooting":{"response":"Someone tried a password from another pod and assumed the switch was broken.","quality":"mistaken"},"impact_urgency":{"response":"This blocks the assigned lab station, but no production service is affected.","quality":"exact"}}'::jsonb),
  ('sc-net-f26-07', 'SETUP: One router, console cable, laptop, patch cable, and equivalent /27 or /28 interface card. Use one LAN interface only.
ROTATION: Each student performs part of console configuration and independently verifies addressing/cabling.
DIAGNOSTIC BRANCHES: Administratively down, wrong mask, wrong laptop gateway, wrong physical interface, or cable fault.
