SIGN-OFF: Individual build, explanation, diagnosis, manufacturer research, repeated verification, complete reset.
PRINTED SERVICE LOG: One individual log linked to ticket; compatibility evidence; build checkpoints; five diagnostic rows; manufacturer source; final firmware inventory; reset initials.
